{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-estimation-lifecycle-cost","title":"工程估价与全生命周期成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/cost-schedule-evm/cost-estimation-lifecycle-cost","wordCount":2175,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"工程估价与全生命周期成本\">工程估价与全生命周期成本</h1><p>招标控制价比中标价高出 18%，竣工结算又比中标价超了 23%——这不是某个项目的偶发失控，而是只盯着&quot;建造期&quot;那一笔钱的造价逻辑的必然结果。一栋办公楼 50 年里花出去的钱，建造成本通常只占两到三成，运营、维护、能耗、改造、拆除分摊的才是大头。工程估价回答&quot;现在这一笔要花多少&quot;，全生命周期成本（LCC）回答&quot;这一笔花法换来的未来要花多少&quot;，二者必须在同一张决策桌上对齐，进度与挣值管理才有一个站得住的成本基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>工程估价（cost estimation）是按工程的实物消耗量与价格，逐层累加出建设各阶段的预期造价；全生命周期成本（Life Cycle Cost）则把时间轴拉到资产报废，把&quot;建造一次性支出&quot;与&quot;持有期持续支出&quot;折现到同一时点比较。两者的关系不是替代，而是嵌套：估价产出的是 LCC 中&quot;建造成本&quot;那一段，LCC 用折现把它和后续几十年的运维流并列。</p>\n<p>国内的估价基准已在换代。国家标准《建设工程工程量清单计价标准》GB/T 50500—2024 由住房城乡建设部 2024 年 11 月 26 日第 212 号公告发布，自 2025 年 9 月 1 日起实施，原 GB 50500—2013 同时废止（<a href=\"https://zjt.hubei.gov.cn/zfxxgk/zc/qtzdgkwj/202508/t20250811_5742884.shtml\">湖北省住建厅公告</a>）。这次修订落实的是《工程造价改革工作方案》（建办标〔2020〕38 号）&quot;清单计量、市场询价、自主报价、竞争定价&quot;的方向，把定额的刚性定价进一步让位给市场形成机制（<a href=\"https://js.shaanxi.gov.cn/sy/yw/zjglfw/zjdt/202501/t20250107_3289541.html\">陕西省住建厅解读</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[投资决策阶段&lt;br/&gt;投资估算] --&gt; B[设计阶段&lt;br/&gt;设计概算]&#10;  B --&gt; C[施工图阶段&lt;br/&gt;施工图预算]&#10;  C --&gt; D[招投标阶段&lt;br/&gt;招标控制价 / 投标报价]&#10;  D --&gt; E[施工阶段&lt;br/&gt;合同价 + 变更 / 计量支付]&#10;  E --&gt; F[竣工阶段&lt;br/&gt;竣工结算]&#10;  F --&gt; G[运营阶段&lt;br/&gt;运维 / 能耗 / 大修]&#10;  G --&gt; H[报废阶段&lt;br/&gt;拆除 / 残值回收]&#10;  A -.全生命周期成本 LCC 视角覆盖全程.-&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[投资决策阶段&lt;br/&gt;投资估算] --&gt; B[设计阶段&lt;br/&gt;设计概算]\n  B --&gt; C[施工图阶段&lt;br/&gt;施工图预算]\n  C --&gt; D[招投标阶段&lt;br/&gt;招标控制价 / 投标报价]\n  D --&gt; E[施工阶段&lt;br/&gt;合同价 + 变更 / 计量支付]\n  E --&gt; F[竣工阶段&lt;br/&gt;竣工结算]\n  F --&gt; G[运营阶段&lt;br/&gt;运维 / 能耗 / 大修]\n  G --&gt; H[报废阶段&lt;br/&gt;拆除 / 残值回收]\n  A -.全生命周期成本 LCC 视角覆盖全程.-&gt; H</pre><p>下表把&quot;只算建造&quot;的传统估价口径和&quot;算到报废&quot;的 LCC 口径放在一起对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>工程估价（传统口径）</th>\n<th>全生命周期成本 LCC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间边界</td>\n<td>决策到竣工</td>\n<td>决策到拆除/回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本主体</td>\n<td>建安造价、设备、土地</td>\n<td>建造 + 运维 + 能耗 + 更新 + 处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间价值</td>\n<td>多数不折现</td>\n<td>必须折现到同一时点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主导阶段</td>\n<td>设计、招投标、施工</td>\n<td>决策与设计阶段锁定 80%+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策问题</td>\n<td>这一笔多少钱、贵不贵</td>\n<td>哪个方案 50 年总账最低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对应标准</td>\n<td>GB/T 50500—2024、GB/T 50353—2025</td>\n<td>ICMS 3、ISO 15686-5、RICS WLCA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工程估价的五阶段精度收敛\">工程估价的五阶段精度收敛</h2><p>估价不是一次算准，而是随信息增加逐步收窄。投资决策阶段只有功能需求和规模，靠类比指标和单位面积造价做投资估算，误差带常在 ±20% 以上；进入初步设计，可按分部分项套概算指标做设计概算；到施工图，工程量可精确算量，施工图预算误差收到 ±5% 上下；招投标阶段，招标人按 GB/T 50500—2024 编制招标控制价（最高限价），投标人据同一份工程量清单自主组价报价；最终以竣工结算落定实际造价。</p>\n<p>精度收敛的代价是修改成本递增。决策阶段改一个方案几乎零成本，施工阶段改一根梁要拆要返工。这正是 LCC 强调&quot;前移&quot;的根因：决策与设计阶段虽只花掉总投资的极小比例，却锁定了后续绝大部分支出的走向——这一&quot;决策阶段杠杆&quot;的相关方与关口机制详见<a href=\"../fundamentals-delivery/lifecycle-and-stakeholders\">建设项目生命周期与利益相关方</a>。</p>\n<p>工程量计算本身也在 2025 年换标。《建筑工程建筑面积计算规范》GB/T 50353—2025 作为配套计算标准之一同步推行，统一了面积计量这一估价最底层的口径（<a href=\"https://doc.quark.cn/preview/xingyeziliao-zhixingbiaozhun-zhixingbiaozhun/E6D9EC9215656636861C4B11FCD1AE51\">新版 GB/T 50353—2025 文档</a>）。底层口径不统一，上层一切单价、指标、报价都不可比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lcc-的折现计算\">LCC 的折现计算</h2><p>LCC 的核心动作是把不同年份发生的成本流折到同一时点。设折现率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 年发生的成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，分析期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 年，则现值总成本为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LCC = \\sum_{t=0}^{n} \\frac{C_t}{(1+r)^t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9185em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 通常是建造期投入（不折现或近似不折现），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t \\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是运营期逐年的运维、能耗、定期大修与最终处置（处置可能是负值，即残值回收）。折现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是结论的杠杆：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 取得越高，未来支出被压得越扁，越偏向&quot;建造省钱&quot;的方案；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 取得越低，未来运维的权重越大，越偏向&quot;建造多花、运营省钱&quot;的高质量方案。</p>\n<p>举一个最小对照：方案甲建造 1000 万元、年运维 80 万元；方案乙建造 1200 万元、年运维 50 万元；分析期 30 年，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>。年金现值系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>1.05</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>0.05</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>15.37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1-(1+r)^{-n}}{r} = \\frac{1-1.05^{-30}}{0.05} \\approx 15.37</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4234em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0784em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8477em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3629em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.05</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1.0</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15.37</span></span></span></span></span>。则甲的 LCC <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15.37</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2230</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 1000 + 80 \\times 15.37 = 2230</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15.37</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2230</span></span></span></span></span> 万元，乙 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>1200</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15.37</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1969</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 1200 + 50 \\times 15.37 = 1969</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15.37</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1969</span></span></span></span></span> 万元——建造贵 200 万的乙，全生命周期反而省 261 万。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 提到 10%，年金系数降到约 9.43，差距会明显收窄，这说明折现率假设必须随项目明示、不能含糊带过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"国际标准-icms-3-与-iso-15686-5\">国际标准：ICMS 3 与 ISO 15686-5</h2><p>国内估价标准管&quot;建造这一段算得准&quot;，国际标准管&quot;全生命周期算得可比&quot;。国际成本管理标准（ICMS）由 ICMS 联盟推动，第一版 2017 年 7 月发布，统一了建造成本的分类与计量；2019 年扩入全生命周期成本；第三版（ICMS 3）于 2021 年发布，进一步把碳排放纳入同一框架，使成本与碳能在资产全程并表分析（<a href=\"https://icms-coalition.org/icms-3/\">ICMS 联盟官网</a>、<a href=\"https://www.rics.org/profession-standards/rics-standards-and-guidance/sector-standards/construction-standards/icms3\">RICS ICMS 标准页</a>）。ICMS 3 由 49 家非政府专业机构联合制定，覆盖从建筑、桥梁到港口、海工结构的造价与碳的基准化报告。</p>\n<p>LCC 的方法学母标准是 ISO 15686-5（建筑与建成资产的服务寿命规划——全生命周期成本核算）。ICMS 在结构上对齐 ISO 15686-5 的全生命周期阶段划分，给&quot;采购—建造—运营—更新—报废&quot;各段提供统一的分类、定义、度量与呈现格式。这条对齐链的意义在于：一个项目在中国按 GB/T 50500—2024 报建造成本，在国际语境里仍能映射到 ICMS 的同一坐标系做跨项目、跨国别的对标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本与碳的并表-从-lcc-到全生命周期碳\">成本与碳的并表：从 LCC 到全生命周期碳</h2><p>2024 年后，LCC 不再是孤立的钱账。RICS 的全生命周期碳评估专业标准（WLCA）第二版于 2023 年 9 月发布，自 2024 年 7 月 1 日起全面生效，适用范围从建筑扩展到全部建筑与基础设施项目，新增了基础设施的碳分类、数据质量方法学与报告模板，RICS 成员完成 WLCA 时必须遵循该标准并记录任何偏离（<a href=\"https://www.rics.org/news-insights/wlca-standard-2nd-edition-now-in-full-effect\">RICS WLCA 第二版生效公告</a>、<a href=\"https://circularecology.com/news/rics-whole-life-carbon-assessment-2nd-edition-now-in-effect\">Circular Ecology 解读</a>）。这与 ICMS 3 把碳并入成本框架是同一趋势的两端：决策时既看 50 年的钱，也看 50 年的碳。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[资产全生命周期] --&gt; B[隐含碳&lt;br/&gt;A1-A5 建材生产与施工]&#10;  A --&gt; C[使用阶段碳&lt;br/&gt;B 运营能耗与维护]&#10;  A --&gt; D[end-of-life 碳&lt;br/&gt;C 拆除处置]&#10;  B --&gt; E[全生命周期碳 WLC]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[与 LCC 并表&lt;br/&gt;同一资产 钱账 + 碳账]\">flowchart TD\n  A[资产全生命周期] --&gt; B[隐含碳&lt;br/&gt;A1-A5 建材生产与施工]\n  A --&gt; C[使用阶段碳&lt;br/&gt;B 运营能耗与维护]\n  A --&gt; D[end-of-life 碳&lt;br/&gt;C 拆除处置]\n  B --&gt; E[全生命周期碳 WLC]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[与 LCC 并表&lt;br/&gt;同一资产 钱账 + 碳账]</pre><p>国内的政策侧也在把 LCC 从工具升级为采购规则。财政部 2026 年 1 月 21 日就推动解决政府采购异常低价问题发文，明确采购人可引入全生命周期成本理念，要求供应商对约定期限内的运营、维护、升级、专用耗材、处置报废等费用一并报价并作为评审因素（<a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/LCC/5127137\">相关政策综述</a>，建议以财政部官方原文为准核验）。这一步把 LCC 从&quot;事后算账&quot;推到了&quot;事前定标&quot;，与挣值管理形成闭环：用 LCC 选出的方案确立成本基线，再用挣值在施工期监控该基线的偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>工程估价算&quot;建造这一笔&quot;，LCC 算&quot;持有几十年&quot;，前者是后者的一个分段，必须在同一决策中对齐。</li>\n<li>国内估价基准已换代：GB/T 50500—2024 自 2025 年 9 月 1 日实施、GB/T 50353—2025 配套计算，方向是市场化定价。</li>\n<li>估价精度随阶段从 ±20% 收敛到 ±5%，但修改成本反向递增，故决策与设计阶段是 LCC 锁定总账的关键。</li>\n<li>LCC 的本质是折现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum C_t/(1+r)^t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0436em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，折现率假设直接决定&quot;建造省&quot;还是&quot;运营省&quot;的结论，必须明示。</li>\n<li>国际侧 ICMS 3（2021）+ ISO 15686-5 统一全生命周期成本口径，RICS WLCA 第二版（2024 年 7 月全面生效）把碳并入同一框架。</li>\n<li>政策侧 LCC 正从算账工具变为采购评标规则，与挣值管理共同构成&quot;选基线—控偏差&quot;的成本闭环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"工程估价与全生命周期成本","id":"工程估价与全生命周期成本"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"工程估价的五阶段精度收敛","id":"工程估价的五阶段精度收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"LCC 的折现计算","id":"lcc-的折现计算"},{"level":2,"text":"国际标准：ICMS 3 与 ISO 15686-5","id":"国际标准-icms-3-与-iso-15686-5"},{"level":2,"text":"成本与碳的并表：从 LCC 到全生命周期碳","id":"成本与碳的并表-从-lcc-到全生命周期碳"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"范围、WBS 与项目集成管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/fundamentals-delivery/scope-wbs-integration"},"next":{"title":"进度计划：CPM 关键路径与资源平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/cost-schedule-evm/cpm-scheduling-resource"}}